<title>BELGIUM: Belgian company investment rose 1.5 pct in Aug.</title>
<headline>Belgian company investment rose 1.5 pct in Aug.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgium's National Statistics Institute (NSI) released the following data on corporate investment, calculated from VAT returns, for August 1996 -</p>
<p>    COMPANY INVESTMENT     Aug 1996   July 96   Aug 1995</p>
<p>    Index (base 100=1985)  171.4	176.7     168.8</p>
<p>    Yr/yr pct change	   1.5	17.6</p>
<p>    COMPANY INVESTMENT     Jan-Aug period    Jan-Aug period</p>
<p>    Yr/yr pct change	 6.0		   6.8</p>
<p>NOTE - Non-industrial investments fell 7.3 percent in the first eight months, industrial investments rose 13.6 percent.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
